Package: morse-halow
Architecture: all
Depends: morse-fgh100m-dkms (= 1.16.4-3),
 morse-firmware (= 20251207-1),
 hostapd-morse-tools (= 1.0-1),
 wpa-supplicant-morse-tools (= 1.0-1),
 morsectrl-tools (= 1.0-1)
Description: Morse Micro Wi-Fi HaLow stack for Wio-WM6108 (metapackage)
 Pulls in the complete, version-locked HaLow (IEEE 802.11ah) stack for
 the Wio-WM6108 module (Quectel FGH100M-H): the morse-fgh100m-dkms
 kernel driver, morse-firmware, morsectrl-tools and the patched
 hostapd/wpa_supplicant builds.
 .
 Exact (=) pins keep the family in lockstep — the driver and its
 firmware must upgrade together, along with the matching userspace
 tools. Bump this package whenever any pinned version moves.
